<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Tabacalera H1 net seen up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Tabacalera H1 net seen up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts of first half consolidated results for Tabacalera, due on Monday. Figures in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>			     H1 1996	H1 1995	  RANGE</p>
<p> Revenues net of VAT   369.5	  337.01	  364-375</p>
<p> Net attrib profit	 7.8	    6.44	  7.4-8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - First half results seen satisfactory but second half will be badly affected by tobacco tax rise in July and end year net profit forecasts point to a result which is at best flat.</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS - BZW, Ahorro Corporacion, ABN-Amro, AB Asesores, Credit Lyonnais</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
